                0.079,
                0.132,
                0.677,
                0.148
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 双曲线  \\( x^{2}-4y^{2}=9 \\)  绕 x 轴旋转一周所生成的旋转曲面的方程是 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.166,
                0.385,
                0.198
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 已知 \\( z = \\frac{x - y}{x + y} \\)，则 \\( \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x} = \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.206,
                0.576,
                0.244
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 改变二次积分的积分次序: \\(\\int_{0}^{1} dx \\int_{0}^{2x} f(x, y) dy =\\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.252,
                0.649,
                0.292
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 设曲面 \\(\\Sigma\\) 为球面 \\(x^{2} + y^{2} + z^{2} = R^{2}\\)，则 \\(\\iint_{\\Sigma}(x^{2} + y^{2} + z^{2})^{2} dS = \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.299,
                0.71,
                0.338
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5. L 是抛物线  \\( y = x^{2} \\)  从点  \\( (0,0) \\)  到点  \\( (2,4) \\)  的一段弧，则  \\( \\int_{L} (x^{2} - y^{2}) dx = \\)  ____",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.349,
                0.469,
                0.367
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、计算题(共5题，每题10分，共50分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.385,
                0.605,
                0.417
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 求过点(2,1,3)且与直线 \\(\\frac{x + 1}{3} = \\frac{y - 1}{2} = \\frac{z}{-1}\\) 垂直相交的直线的方程.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.078,
                0.439,
                0.496,
                0.474
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 求曲线 \\(\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} x^{2} + y^{2} - z = 0 \\\\ x^{2} + 2y^{2} + 3z^{2} - 15 = 0 \\end{array} \\right.\\) 在点(1,1,2)处的切线方程.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.51,
                0.461,
                0.526
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 求二元函数 \\( f(x, y) = x^{2}(2 + y^{2}) + y \\ln y \\) 的极值.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.57,
                0.917,
                0.613
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 计算 \\(\\iint_{\\Sigma} (y^2 - x) dy dz + (z^2 - y) dz dx + (x^2 - z) dx dy\\)，其中 \\(\\Sigma\\) 为抛物面 \\(z = 2 - x^2 - y^2\\)，\\((1 \\leq z \\leq 2)\\) 的上侧.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.664,
                0.265,
                0.711
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5. 求 \\(\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{x^{n-1}}{n}\\) 的和函数.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
